itness and athletic goals."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Directions: As a dietary supplement, mix one (1) scoop in 8 oz of water or your favorite drink immediately post-workout or first thing in the morning on non-workout days."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Warnings: Keep out of reach of children. Consult your physician prior to using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, under 18 years of age, taking medication or have a medical condition."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Consult your physician prior to using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, under 18 years of age, taking medication or have a medical condition."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Immediately discontinue use and contact your physician if any adverse reactions occur."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place away from excessive heat."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Enhance muscle recovery\r\nPost-workout muscle maximizer"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"1.6 g Carnosyn beta alanine\r\nGreen apple 100% naturally flavored and sweetened"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"This product is manufactured in a facility which may also process milk, soy, wheat, egg, peanuts, tree nuts, fish and shellfish."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"CreaPure\r\nCarnoSyn\r\nAstraGin"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"CreaPure is a registered trademark of AlzChem Trostberg GmbH, Germany.\r\nCarnoSyn is a registered trademark of Natural Alternatives International, Inc.\r\nNuMalic is a registered trademark of NutriScience Innovations, LLC."}],"claims":[{"langualC